      "text": "Group        Columns        Notes\nRow identifier        row_id        unique per line, the only reliable key\nOrder        order_id, order_date, ship_date, ship_mode, order_priority        4 ship modes (Same Day, First, Second, Standard Class); 4 priorities (Critical, High, Medium, Low)\nCustomer        customer_id, customer_name, segment        3 segments: Consumer, Corporate, Home Office\nLocation        city, state, country, postal_code, market, region        markets: US, Canada, LATAM, EU, EMEA, Africa, APAC; postal codes only in the US\nProduct        product_id, product_name, category, sub_category        3 categories (Furniture, Office Supplies, Technology) split into 17 sub-categories\nMeasures        sales, quantity, discount, profit, shipping_cost        the numbers you'll sum and analyse",
