      "text": "WITH ranked AS (\n            SELECT *,\n                   ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY row_id ORDER BY row_id) AS rn\n            FROM stage.superstore_raw\n) \n...\n...\n FROM ranked\n        WHERE rn = 1;\n",
